atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/29d948e209cd21474bbfd0bc02d1fc6b.poster.avif?t=1731928024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/29d948e209cd21474bbfd0bc02d1fc6b.webm?t=1731928024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/29d948e209cd21474bbfd0bc02d1fc6b.mp4?t=1731928024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOURSELF, YOU CANNOT MOVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You CANNOT MOVE in this game! You're glued to your chair, and have to constantly watch your back to scare the pumpkin man away while solving the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/c56223fb20b79796ebb19e1f408d3fbf.poster.avif?t=1731928024\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/c56223fb20b79796ebb19e1f408d3fbf.webm?t=1731928024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310610/extras/c56223fb20b79796ebb19e1f408d3fbf.mp4?t=1731928024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
